# detections/rule-ids.lock.json pins (category, slug) -> rule id so that
# regenerating the corpus cannot renumber an existing rule. The *keys* are
# rule slugs, and the detections that hunt for credential abuse are named
# after what they detect — "ai-prompt-contained-credential",
# "api-key-leak-in-request", "slack-token-exposed". The values are rule ids
# of the form det-application-085. Nothing in this file is a secret; the
